{
  "id": "poem-f85cdc53d5be20082726f029",
  "title": "字字双",
  "author": "柯丹邱《荆钗记》",
  "dynasty": "元",
  "verses": [
    "［净上］试官没眼他及第，得志。",
    "恋着相府多荣贵，入赘。",
    "不思贫窘弃前妻，忘义。",
    "叵耐穷酸太无知，呕气。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "元曲选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/元曲/yuanqu.json#record-8192",
